{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"duzhou-e-o048","title":"刘璋迎琬妻来敏入蜀","accounts":[{"id":"duzhou-a-ce8547f0c75b7cdce6e2","label":"正文","text":"黄琬是刘璋祖母之侄，故刘璋遣迎黄琬妻（来敏姊）；来敏遂与姊俱入蜀。","evidence":["duzhou-q-e01eb75c730afecbb496","duzhou-q2-6cb9d477bf685354ef05"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0253","role":"因黄琬为其祖母之侄，遣迎黄琬妻","evidence":["duzhou-q-e01eb75c730afecbb496","duzhou-q2-6cb9d477bf685354ef05"]},{"person":"jfj-p0012","role":"随姊入蜀","evidence":["duzhou-q-e01eb75c730afecbb496","duzhou-q2-6cb9d477bf685354ef05"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["duzhou-q-e01eb75c730afecbb496"]},"ordering_evidence":"duzhou-q-e01eb75c730afecbb496","source_order":[42,171,62],"order":7516}],"persons":[{"id":"jfj-p0012","name":"来敏","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0253","name":"刘璋","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"duzhou-q-e01eb75c730afecbb496","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-c50e18738e0ca7813a82","layer":"original","quote":"故璋遣迎琬妻；敏遂俱与姊入蜀，常为璋宾客","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":62,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q2-6cb9d477bf685354ef05","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-c50e18738e0ca7813a82","layer":"original","quote":"来敏字敬达，义阳新野人。来歙之后也〖1〗。父艳〖2〗，为汉司空。﹝一﹞汉末大乱，敏随姊（夫）奔荆州。姊夫黄琬是刘璋祖母之侄，故璋遣迎琬妻；敏遂俱与姊入蜀，常为璋宾客。涉猎书籍，善左氏《春秋》〖3〗，尤精于《仓》、《雅》训诂〖4〗，好是正文字〖5〗。","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
